<body>
    <h1>Portal de Automa=C3=A7=C3=A3o de M=C3=A1rcio</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"9a4d19184244" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=
=C3=A1rcio-1.Vis=C3=A3oGeral">1. Vis=C3=A3o Geral</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2b305d91151f">Este sistema foi desenvolvido para eliminar o =
processamento manual de relat=C3=B3rios de faturamento extra=C3=ADdos do ER=
P Sankhya. A solu=C3=A7=C3=A3o automatiza a segrega=C3=A7=C3=A3o de dados p=
or conv=C3=AAnio, higieniza informa=C3=A7=C3=B5es cr=C3=ADticas (como CNPJ)=
 e gera um dashboard visual imediato para confer=C3=AAncia financeira.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"36b6eedafe32" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-2.ArquiteturadaSolu=C3=A7=C3=A3o">2. Arquitetura da Solu=C3=A7=C3=A3o</h2=
>
<p local-id=3D"4ea4e378ad60">A solu=C3=A7=C3=A3o utiliza o ecossistema Goog=
le Workspace da Saavedra para garantir seguran=C3=A7a e custo zero:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3475fc72-0d3b-4a82-9f90-861ebf1f448b">
<li local-id=3D"ca4716c9-2506-4ed7-b7f8-508e9aaf2b50">
<p local-id=3D"d066604a0c49"><strong>Interface:</strong> Web App desenvolvi=
do em HTML5/CSS3 com branding Saavedra.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fffa07a1-8001-4c99-8348-a80bf65a8c28">
<p local-id=3D"e379b21b0d85"><strong>Processamento Client-side:</strong> Bi=
blioteca <code>SheetJS</code> para leitura r=C3=A1pida de bin=C3=A1rios Exc=
el no navegador.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"69454832-50bd-48bf-beb6-96f6afaf7f08">
<p local-id=3D"1a8481c7ce01"><strong>Motor de Regras:</strong> Google Apps =
Script (V8 Engine) para manipula=C3=A7=C3=A3o de dados e l=C3=B3gica de neg=
=C3=B3cio.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"140009ea-66bb-4f3f-a235-899530ab1ac3">
<p local-id=3D"4524a6fee9cc"><strong>Armazenamento:</strong> Google Drive (=
arquivos processados temporariamente).</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"21c3e1c2bcd9" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-3.RegrasdeNeg=C3=B3cioImplementadas">3. Regras de Neg=C3=B3cio Implementa=
das</h2>
<p local-id=3D"930b2180fed8">O sistema categoriza automaticamente as linhas=
 do relat=C3=B3rio com base nas seguintes prioridades:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1c9bf8ad-3e38-406c-993d-29c3f11fccf6">
<li local-id=3D"f0ad4cff-1bce-4955-85ed-cbc578325eee">
<p local-id=3D"894d8015f7b2"><strong>UNIMED:</strong> Identificada via Raz=
=C3=A3o Social ou campo Conv=C3=AAnio.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e89b49e8-83cc-4604-8f62-ac444f800a9e">
<p local-id=3D"3f106aa27c96"><strong>PUC:</strong> Uni=C3=A3o Brasileira de=
 Educa=C3=A7=C3=A3o e Assist=C3=AAncia.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e229a571-15ef-4f9b-bd55-0d4b701f8b51">
<p local-id=3D"efdcc46859e8"><strong>HCAA:</strong> Complexo Hospitalar Ast=
rogildo de Azevedo.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87f3b402-8ba5-4711-aac6-749f4c1f4654">
<p local-id=3D"c278be901f84"><strong>H.DIVINA:</strong> Sociedade Sulina Di=
vina Provid=C3=AAncia.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eaa5990d-7701-41f9-8574-9c4b6728d150">
<p local-id=3D"546b44241e23"><strong>NORMAL:</strong> Fluxo residual para d=
emais conv=C3=AAnios.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"15a35d6be5d4" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-4.FuncionalidadesdeAuditoriaeLimpeza">4. Funcionalidades de Auditoria e L=
impeza</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"53cd828a-de9e-4c28-8b71-540e9afa2bcf">
<li local-id=3D"689de54f-46e9-44e9-8d86-d2b247073bf9">
<p local-id=3D"a5dbe454d406"><strong>Normaliza=C3=A7=C3=A3o de Colunas:</st=
rong> Remove acentos, pontos e espa=C3=A7os para evitar quebras no banco de=
 dados.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fcc96b3c-446f-4b7a-a38d-c95dd74aa3c6">
<p local-id=3D"9a3fc479f35b"><strong>Corre=C3=A7=C3=A3o de CNPJ:</strong> F=
or=C3=A7a o formato de texto puro para evitar que o Excel converta n=C3=BAm=
eros longos em nota=C3=A7=C3=A3o cient=C3=ADfica (<code>E+13</code>).</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"9bf7fe97-de16-4e19-a629-daafcd2d15e0">
<p local-id=3D"9e6215f8393c"><strong>Higieniza=C3=A7=C3=A3o de NaNs:</stron=
g> Remove valores nulos, deixando as c=C3=A9lulas em branco para um visual =
limpo.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"971b9d72-41c8-4f50-a78d-877350b442dd">
<p local-id=3D"3650eef95c54"><strong>Formata=C3=A7=C3=A3o Cont=C3=A1bil:</s=
trong> Aplica automaticamente <code>R$ #,##0.00</code> em colunas de Valor =
e Totais.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"e46572cd1d9d" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-5.C=C3=B3digos-Fonte">5. C=C3=B3digos-Fonte</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"6adb26f348cf" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-A.MotordoSistema(C=C3=B3digo.gs)">A. Motor do Sistema (<code>C=C3=B3digo.=
gs</code>)</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">JavaScr=
ipt</pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">function =
doGet() {
  return HtmlService.createTemplateFromFile('Index')
      .evaluate()
      .setTitle('Portal Financeiro - Saavedra')
      .setXFrameOptionsMode(HtmlService.XFrameOptionsMode.ALLOWALL);
}

const CORES =3D {
  'UNIMED': '#C6EFCE', 'PUC': '#DDEBF7', 'H.DIVINA': '#F2DCDB', 'HCAA': '#F=
FF2CC', 'NORMAL': '#E2E2E2'
};

function processarERetornarArquivo(jsonData, fileName) {
  try {
    const data =3D JSON.parse(jsonData);
    const ss =3D SpreadsheetApp.create('PROCESSADO_' + fileName);
    const spreadsheetId =3D ss.getId();
   =20
    const resSheet =3D ss.getSheets()[0];
    resSheet.setName('RESUMO');
   =20
    const clientes =3D ['UNIMED', 'PUC', 'H.DIVINA', 'HCAA', 'NORMAL'];
    let resumoRows =3D [['PEDIDO', 'Ref Prod', 'Descri=C3=A7=C3=A3o', 'Qtd =
Com', 'VLR UNIT', 'VLR TOTAL']];
    let coresResumo =3D [];

    clientes.forEach(cli =3D&gt; {
      let subset =3D data.filter(r =3D&gt; atribuirAba(r) =3D=3D=3D cli);
      if (subset.length &gt; 0) {
        let itens =3D {};
        subset.forEach(r =3D&gt; {
          let chave =3D r.REFPROD + '|' + r.DESCRICAO;
          if (!itens[chave]) itens[chave] =3D { qtd: 0, total: 0 };
          itens[chave].qtd +=3D parseFloat(r.QTDCOM || 0);
          itens[chave].total +=3D parseFloat(r.VLRTOTAL || 0);
        });
       =20
        let subtotal =3D 0;
        Object.keys(itens).forEach(k =3D&gt; {
          let [ref, desc] =3D k.split('|');
          let vlrUnit =3D itens[k].total / itens[k].qtd;
          resumoRows.push([cli, ref, desc, itens[k].qtd, vlrUnit, itens[k].=
total]);
          coresResumo.push(CORES[cli]);
          subtotal +=3D itens[k].total;
        });
        resumoRows.push(['', '', 'TOTAL ACUMULADO ' + cli, '', '', subtotal=
]);
        coresResumo.push(CORES[cli]);
      }
    });
   =20
    resSheet.getRange(1, 1, resumoRows.length, 6).setValues(resumoRows);
    coresResumo.forEach((cor, index) =3D&gt; {
      resSheet.getRange(index + 2, 1, 1, 6).setBackground(cor);
      if (resumoRows[index+1][2].includes('TOTAL ACUMULADO')) {
        resSheet.getRange(index + 2, 1, 1, 6).setFontWeight('bold');
      }
    });
    formatarMoeda(resSheet, resumoRows.length);

    clientes.forEach(cli =3D&gt; {
      let subset =3D data.filter(r =3D&gt; atribuirAba(r) =3D=3D=3D cli);
      if (subset.length &gt; 0) {
        let sheet =3D ss.insertSheet(cli);
        let header =3D ['CONTRATO', 'CNPJ_PARCEIRO', 'UF', 'COD_CLI_USO', '=
RAZ=C3=83O SOCIAL', 'CNPJ_PARC_USO', 'CONVENIO', 'Ref Prod', 'Descri=C3=A7=
=C3=A3o', 'Qtd'];
       =20
        let rows =3D subset.map(r =3D&gt; [
          r.CONTRATOCLIENTE,=20
          "'" + String(r.CNPJPARCEIRO || "").replace(/\D/g, ""),=20
          r.UF, r.CODCLIUSO, r.RAZAOSOCIAL,=20
          "'" + String(r.CNPJPARCUSO || "").replace(/\D/g, ""),=20
          r.CONVENIO, r.REFPROD, r.DESCRICAO, r.QTDCOM
        ]);
       =20
        sheet.getRange(1, 1, 1, 10).setValues([header]).setBackground('#333=
333').setFontColor('white').setFontWeight('bold');
        sheet.getRange(2, 1, rows.length, 10).setValues(rows).setBackground=
(CORES[cli]);
       =20
        // Resumo interno da aba
        let itensCli =3D {};
        subset.forEach(r =3D&gt; {
           let chave =3D r.REFPROD + '|' + r.DESCRICAO;
           if(!itensCli[chave]) itensCli[chave] =3D {qtd: 0, total: 0};
           itensCli[chave].qtd +=3D parseFloat(r.QTDCOM || 0);
           itensCli[chave].total +=3D parseFloat(r.VLRTOTAL || 0);
        });

        let startR =3D rows.length + 4;
        sheet.getRange(startR, 1, 1, 5).setValues([['Ref Prod', 'Descri=C3=
=A7=C3=A3o', 'Qtd Com', 'VLR UNIT', 'VLR TOTAL']]).setFontWeight('bold');
        let resumoCliRows =3D Object.keys(itensCli).map(k =3D&gt; {
           let [ref, desc] =3D k.split('|');
           return [ref, desc, itensCli[k].qtd, (itensCli[k].total / itensCl=
i[k].qtd), itensCli[k].total];
        });
        sheet.getRange(startR + 1, 1, resumoCliRows.length, 5).setValues(re=
sumoCliRows);
        sheet.getRange(startR + resumoCliRows.length + 1, 2, 1, 4).setValue=
s([['TOTAL GERAL', '', '', subset.reduce((a,b) =3D&gt; a + parseFloat(b.VLR=
TOTAL || 0), 0)]]).setFontWeight('bold');
        sheet.getRange(startR + 1, 4, resumoCliRows.length + 1, 2).setNumbe=
rFormat('R$ #,##0.00');
      }
    });

    return { success: true, fileUrl: "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/=
d/" + spreadsheetId + "/export?format=3Dxlsx" };
  } catch (e) {
    return { success: false, message: e.toString() };
  }
}

function atribuirAba(r) {
  let razao =3D String(r.RAZAOSOCIAL || '').toUpperCase();
  let conv =3D String(r.CONVENIO || '').toUpperCase();
  if (razao.includes('UNIMED') || conv.includes('UNIMED')) return 'UNIMED';
  if (razao.includes('UNIAO BRASILEIRA DE EDUCACAO')) return 'PUC';
  if (razao.includes('ASTROGILDO DE AZEVEDO')) return 'HCAA';
  if (razao.includes('DIVINA PROVIDENCIA')) return 'H.DIVINA';
  return 'NORMAL';
}

function formatarMoeda(sheet, lastRow) {
  sheet.getRange(2, 5, lastRow, 2).setNumberFormat('R$ #,##0.00');
  sheet.getRange("A1:F1").setBackground('#F37021').setFontColor('white').se=
tFontWeight('bold');
}
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"cd745b2b9e44" id=3D"PortaldeAutoma=C3=A7=C3=A3odeM=C3=A1rci=
o-B.InterfaceFront-end(Index.html)">B. Interface Front-end (<code>Index.htm=
l</code>)</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">HTML</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: html; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">&lt;!DO=
CTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
  &lt;base target=3D"_top"&gt;
  &lt;script src=3D"https://cdn.sheetjs.com/xlsx-0.19.3/package/dist/xlsx.f=
ull.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; displa=
y: flex; justify-content: center; padding-top: 30px; }
    .card { background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 15px; border-t=
op: 8px solid #F37021; width: 500px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)=
; text-align: center; }
    .btn { background: #F37021; color: white; border: none; padding: 15px; =
width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; margin=
-top: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
    .btn:disabled { background: #ccc; cursor: not-allowed; }
    #log-container { background: #1a1a1a; color: #00ff00; padding: 15px; bo=
rder-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; =
font-size: 12px; height: 150px; overflow-y: auto; text-align: left; }
    input[type=3D"file"] { margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding:=
 10px; width: 90%; border-radius: 5px; }
  &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
  &lt;div class=3D"card"&gt;
    &lt;img src=3D"https://www.saavedra.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/l=
ogo-saavedra.png" width=3D"150"&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;Automa=C3=A7=C3=A3o Saavedra N3&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Processador de Relat=C3=B3rios Sankhya&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;input type=3D"file" id=3D"fileInput" accept=3D".xls,.xlsx"&gt;
    &lt;button id=3D"mainBtn" class=3D"btn"&gt;EXECUTAR PROCESSAMENTO&lt;/b=
utton&gt;
    &lt;div id=3D"log-container"&gt;&gt; Aguardando arquivo...&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;script&gt;
    const btn =3D document.getElementById('mainBtn');
    const log =3D document.getElementById('log-container');
    function addLog(msg) { log.innerHTML +=3D `&lt;br&gt;&gt; ${msg}`; log.=
scrollTop =3D log.scrollHeight; }

    btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
      const file =3D document.getElementById('fileInput').files[0];
      if (!file) return alert("Selecione o arquivo!");
      btn.disabled =3D true;
      addLog("Lendo arquivo: " + file.name);
      const reader =3D new FileReader();
      reader.onload =3D function(e) {
        try {
          const data =3D new Uint8Array(e.target.result);
          const wb =3D XLSX.read(data, {type: 'array'});
          const rawData =3D XLSX.utils.sheet_to_json(wb.Sheets[wb.SheetName=
s[0]], {range: 2});
          addLog(`Sucesso: ${rawData.length} linhas lidas.`);
          const cleanedData =3D rawData.map(row =3D&gt; {
            let newRow =3D {};
            Object.keys(row).forEach(k =3D&gt; {
              let cleanKey =3D k.normalize("NFD").replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/=
g, "").toUpperCase().replace(/[.\s_-]/g, "");
              newRow[cleanKey] =3D row[k] =3D=3D null ? "" : row[k];
            });
            return newRow;
          });
          addLog("Enviando para o Google Cloud...");
          google.script.run
            .withSuccessHandler(res =3D&gt; {
              if(res.success) {
                addLog("CONCLU=C3=8DDO! Baixando...");
                window.location.href =3D res.fileUrl;
              } else { addLog("ERRO: " + res.message); }
              btn.disabled =3D false;
            })
            .processarERetornarArquivo(JSON.stringify(cleanedData), file.na=
me);
        } catch (err) { addLog("ERRO: " + err.message); btn.disabled =3D fa=
lse; }
      };
      reader.readAsArrayBuffer(file);
    });
  &lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</pre>
